Not just that -- the fact that the higher level monsters can actually do
damage to you now hinders extinctionists.  It's one thing to leave a
burned E on a level and go nuts slaying everything that comes near, but
it's another thing entirely when everything will chip away at you.
Also, the higher hit points and AC of higher level monsters will make
this less trivial; and the player-monsters on Astral with the extremely
kitted out equipment are just not worth fighting, according to reports.

